{"id":"e9120e73a451193b","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Expectation Functional","display":"df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional — ZFC Prob2 Expectation Functional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional — ZFC Prob2 Expectation Functional","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional — ZFC Prob2 Expectation Functional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation\">58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,X,\\mathbb P \\in V\">\\(e,X,\\mathbb P \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation\">58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}expectation\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S(e,X,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})=1\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land e\\in\\mathbb R\\land e=\\int_{\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}}X\\,d\\mathbb P\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}expectation\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S(e,X,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})=1\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land e\\in\\mathbb R\\land e=\\int_{\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}}X\\,d\\mathbb P\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该三元谓词描述期望泛函在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 处的值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>；概率空间和可积性条件确保积分是有限实数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}$, $\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}$, and $\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S$ are defined in [[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ is the three-place predicate from [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,X,\\mathbb P \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}expectatio